   "speech": "再加门的三个权重一个偏置，一共十二。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 10,
   "start": 255.43,
   "dur": 3.81,
   "speech": "SAN 的统计量：每一片的 mu 和 sigma。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 11,
   "start": 259.42,
   "dur": 4.29,
   "speech": "片长 tau，片数 M 等于 T 除以 tau。"
  },
