   "index": 12,
   "start": 263.88,
   "dur": 2.56,
   "speech": "每一片独立归一化。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 13,
   "start": 266.62,
   "dur": 4.67,
   "speech": "再拿一个 MLP，从上一片的统计量猜下一片。"
  },
  {
