   "index": 28,
   "start": 326.7,
   "dur": 3.9,
   "speech": "前者是预处理，后者是模型的一部分。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 29,
   "start": 330.78,
   "dur": 4.38,
   "speech": "所以 RevIN 必须可逆，Z-score 不需要。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 30,
   "start": 335.34,
   "dur": 3.66,
   "speech": "这也是三条桥接里最基础的一条。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 0,
   "start": 342.41,
   "dur": 3.54,
   "speech": "同一个形状：减中心，除尺度。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 1,
   "start": 346.13,
   "dur": 2.49,
   "speech": "为什么是这两个操作？"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 2,
   "start": 348.8,
   "dur": 2.63,
   "speech": "减中心，去掉水平。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 3,
   "start": 351.61,
   "dur": 2.61,
   "speech": "除尺度，去掉大小。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 4,
   "start": 354.39,
   "dur": 3.11,
   "speech": "剩下的只有一个东西：形状。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 5,
   "start": 357.68,
   "dur": 3.52,
   "speech": "不同股票的价格量级差几十倍。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 6,
   "start": 361.38,
   "dur": 3.76,
   "speech": "归一化之后，它们才在同一个坐标系里。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 7,
   "start": 365.32,
   "dur": 2.56,
   "speech": "那三个零件差在哪？"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 8,
   "start": 368.06,
   "dur": 3.85,
   "speech": "第一个问题：统计量是算的，还是学的？"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 9,
   "start": 372.09,
   "dur": 4.55,
   "speech": "RevIN 算，DAIN 学，SAN 学和用各一半。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 10,
   "start": 376.82,
   "dur": 3.9,
   "speech": "第二个问题：统计量的作用范围有多大？"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 11,
   "start": 380.9,
   "dur": 2.56,
   "speech": "整段，还是每一片？"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 12,
   "start": 383.64,
   "dur": 3.61,
   "speech": "第三个问题：反变换用哪一份统计量？"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 13,
   "start": 387.44,
   "dur": 2.05,
   "speech": "这就是可逆性。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 14,
   "start": 389.67,
   "dur": 3.54,
   "speech": "我们拿真实数据回答了第二个问题。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 15,
   "start": 393.39,
   "dur": 3.47,
   "speech": "一百二十只票，每只二百五十天。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 16,
   "start": 397.04,
   "dur": 3.18,
   "speech": "切成十片，每片二十五天。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 17,
   "start": 400.4,
   "dur": 4.98,
   "speech": "片内 sigma 与整段 sigma 的比，平均是零点三九。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 18,
   "start": 405.57,
   "dur": 5.25,
   "speech": "意思是，整段 sigma 里混着局部波动和整段的漂移。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 19,
   "start": 410.99,
   "dur": 3.76,
   "speech": "整段一个 sigma，把这些混成一锅。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 20,
   "start": 414.93,
   "dur": 3.95,
   "speech": "每片一个 sigma，只留下片内那部分。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 21,
   "start": 419.06,
   "dur": 2.97,
   "speech": "这就是 SAN 存在的理由。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 22,
   "start": 422.21,
   "dur": 4.31,
   "speech": "粒度不止影响统计量，还影响谁被平均。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 23,
   "start": 426.7,
   "dur": 4.98,
   "speech": "整段统计量把趋势算进方差，片统计量不算。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 24,
   "start": 431.86,
   "dur": 4.67,
   "speech": "这对预测是好处还是坏处，取决于漂移多快。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 25,
   "start": 436.71,
   "dur": 5.44,
   "speech": "漂移慢，整段够用；漂移快，分片更灵敏，也更吵。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 26,
   "start": 442.33,
   "dur": 2.85,
   "speech": "为什么分片能代表局部？"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 27,
   "start": 445.35,
   "dur": 3.45,
   "speech": "因为一段里的均值和方差变化慢。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 28,
   "start": 448.98,
   "dur": 3.04,
   "speech": "这句话是假设，不是定理。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 29,
   "start": 452.2,
   "dur": 3.57,
   "speech": "假设不成立，分片统计量就没用。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 30,
   "start": 455.94,
   "dur": 4.6,
   "speech": "所以 SAN 的收益，依赖数据本身的平稳程度。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 31,
   "start": 460.72,
   "dur": 3.23,
   "speech": "这一点，下一集会正面处理。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 0,
   "start": 467.35,
   "dur": 3.73,
   "speech": "实现层面，三个模块都是几十行。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 1,
   "start": 471.26,
   "dur": 2.39,
   "speech": "RevIN 最干净。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 2,
   "start": 473.83,
   "dur": 3.73,
   "speech": "两遍扫描：第一遍算 mu 和 sigma。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 3,
   "start": 477.75,
   "dur": 2.37,
   "speech": "第二遍减和除。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 4,
   "start": 480.29,
   "dur": 3.66,
   "speech": "反变换用保存下来的那一份统计量。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 5,
   "start": 484.14,
   "dur": 2.7,
   "speech": "只许复用，不许重算。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 6,
   "start": 487.02,
   "dur": 4.14,
   "speech": "重算就不是同一次变换，往返也对不上。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 7,
   "start": 491.34,
   "dur": 3.23,
   "speech": "DAIN 的核心是两个线性映射。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 8,
   "start": 494.75,
   "dur": 3.69,
   "speech": "alpha 等于三个特征的线性组合。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 9,
   "start": 498.62,
   "dur": 2.65,
   "speech": "beta 也一样的形状。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 10,
   "start": 501.45,
   "dur": 2.2,
   "speech": "分母要加保护。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 11,
   "start": 503.83,
   "dur": 2.75,
   "speech": "beta 可能正好是零。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 12,
   "start": 506.76,
   "dur": 3.76,
   "speech": "所以取绝对值再挤一个 eps。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 13,
   "start": 510.7,
   "dur": 4.41,
   "speech": "门是一个 sigmoid，把归一化结果整体缩放。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 14,
   "start": 515.28,
   "dur": 2.68,
   "speech": "书中没有关门的开关。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 15,
   "start": 518.14,
   "dur": 3.16,
   "speech": "但做桥接测试必须能关。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 16,
   "start": 521.48,
   "dur": 2.73,
   "speech": "我们加了一个显式开关。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 17,
   "start": 524.38,
   "dur": 2.89,
   "speech": "SAN 的第一件事是分片。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 18,
   "start": 527.46,
   "dur": 5.03,
   "speech": "片数 M 等于 T 除以 tau，整除不了的部分丢掉。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 19,
   "start": 532.67,
   "dur": 3.06,
   "speech": "这是我们的选择，书里没写。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 20,
   "start": 535.91,
   "dur": 2.85,
   "speech": "丢多少行，要打印出来。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 21,
   "start": 538.94,
   "dur": 4.79,
   "speech": "SAN 的 MLP 是两维进，八维隐，两维出。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 22,
   "start": 543.91,
   "dur": 4.07,
   "speech": "训练只做第一阶段：预测下一片的统计量。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 23,
   "start": 548.16,
   "dur": 4.09,
   "speech": "第二阶段要完整预测器，那是后面的集。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 24,
   "start": 552.43,
   "dur": 2.75,
   "speech": "三个模块的接口都很小。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 25,
   "start": 555.36,
   "dur": 4.12,
   "speech": "revin 收一个矩阵，返回矩阵加统计量。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 26,
   "start": 559.66,
   "dur": 4.07,
   "speech": "revinInv 收那份统计量，返回矩阵。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 27,
   "start": 563.91,
   "dur": 5.25,
   "speech": "sanForward 多返回一样东西：分片统计，供下一片预测用。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 28,
   "start": 569.33,
   "dur": 4.96,
   "speech": "测试是十三、十五、十四，共四十二条断言。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 29,
   "start": 574.47,
   "dur": 4.36,
   "speech": "整个仓库现在是四百零九条，五十五个套件。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "verification",
   "index": 0,
   "start": 582.23,
   "dur": 2.8,
   "speech": "三条桥接，全部零。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "verification",
   "index": 1,
   "start": 585.21,
   "dur": 4.69,
   "speech": "第一条：eps 归零，RevIN 就是 Z-score。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "verification",
   "index": 2,
   "start": 590.08,
   "dur": 5.44,
   "speech": "第二条：把 alpha、beta 换成真值，就回到 RevIN。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "verification",
   "index": 3,
   "start": 595.7,
   "dur": 4.21,
   "speech": "第三条：SAN 的 tau 取 T，统计量给真值。"
  },
